      <title>There's a lot of ground to cover when you're building a Moon Base.</title>
      <link>https://www.facebook.com/reel/1863947697952668</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fb-post-1662401645255205</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:06:10 +0700</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;There&amp;#x27;s a lot of ground to cover when you&amp;#x27;re building a Moon Base.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;During the first phase of Moon Base development, robotic rovers will gather new details about the lunar South Pole region, while lunar terrain vehicles will extend the reach of each Artemis mission.  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Take a look at some of the vehicles helping pave the way for an enduring human presence on the Moon: https://go.nasa.gov/47xjWT5&lt;/div&gt;
