    <item>
      <title>Have you seen our new episode of Planetary Defenders yet?</title>
      <link>https://www.facebook.com/NASA/posts/pfbid02XutFMZjjmxa3JV87hzfkwQs2q8jK56hm6vQqTMyJxG4YMBEWRhEqLmt9j5MzQxbsl</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fb-post-1656760789152624</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:16:24 +0700</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;Have you seen our new episode of Planetary Defenders yet?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Scientists are keeping their eyes on the skies to protect humanity from asteroids and other impact threats to Earth. Our latest documentary, &amp;quot;This Is Not an Exercise,&amp;quot; tells the behind-the-scenes story of a real-world scenario that put our planetary defense system to the test like never before.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Watch the full episode on our YouTube channel: https://youtu.be/5b3n-u_0QAI&lt;/div&gt;
