      <title>Just a few more weeks until our biggest event of the year!</title>
      <link>https://www.facebook.com/reel/1686472756520976</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fb-post-1655978522564184</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:47:15 +0700</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;Just a few more weeks until our biggest event of the year!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;MAX POWER, a new aerospace tech expo and air show, is happening Nov. 7-8 at NASA&amp;#x27;s Kennedy Space Center in Florida. This event includes aircraft flyovers and static displays, immersive exhibits, astronaut appearances, and behind-the-scenes access to America&amp;#x27;s spaceport. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Got questions? Check out our FAQs to help plan your visit: https://go.nasa.gov/4iiNPN3&lt;/div&gt;
